- **One vocabulary, defined once.** New enums are declared in `lib/ai/tagging-schema.ts` and re-exported from `lib/closet/vocab.ts` — the direction the existing `MATERIALS`/`TEXTURES` already flow, because `vocab` derives `CATEGORIES`/`SEASONS` from `TagSchema` and the reverse import would be a cycle.
- **Model id is `claude-haiku-4-5`.** Do not change the tagging model in this plan.
- **AI tags are always a draft.** Every AI-filled field appears on the confirm screen for correction before any row is written. `confirmItem` re-validates with `TagSchema.parse` — a field that skips the confirm screen still gets parsed.
